<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/substatement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An xAPI Statement-like Object embedded inside another Statement. It contains an Actor, Verb, and Object and may include Result, Context, Timestamp, and Attachments, but cannot itself contain another SubStatement." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/substatement/versions/1> .
