<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/substatement> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "SubStatements let a Statement describe another structured experience as its Object while preventing unbounded nesting." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/substatement/versions/1> .
